<div style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; padding: 20px 0;">
        <img src="https://example.com/failure-logo.png" alt="Failure" style="width: 100px;">
    </div>
    <div style="background-color: #e74c3c; color: #ffffff; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;">
        <h2 style="margin: 0;">Auto Renew Subscription Failed</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="padding: 20px; color: #333333;">
        <p>Hello Dear, <strong><%= name %></strong>!</p>
        <p>
            We regret to inform you that your subscription has expired and the auto-renewal failed due to <strong><%= pin %></strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
            To continue enjoying our services, please reactivate your subscription, fund your wallet, or save valid card details to prevent future failures.
        </p>
        <p>We appreciate you choosing REEPLAY. Thank you!</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 10px 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;">
        <p>Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@reeplay.app" style="color: #e74c3c;">support@reeplay.app</a></p>
        <p style="color: #888888;">&copy; 2024 REEPLAY. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</div>
